1579	Key constants: `CACHE_VERSION = 2`; `MAX_CACHE_BYTES = 100 * 1024 * 1024` (100 MB). Cache file path: `<root>/.monokl/cache.json`. Atomic write: `.monokl/cache.json.<pid>.tmp` then rename (per-process temp prevents nextest races). LRU eviction in batches of `(len/10).max(1)` with re-check after each full chunk. Cache is rejected when `version != CACHE_VERSION || config_hash != ...` → `MonoklError::StaleDiskCache`, treated as cold start in `init()`.
